Third-party software distributed alongside this product
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Waypoint is designed to be packaged as an appliance (see docs/adr/0001-packaging.md).
A packaged appliance redistributes third-party software that is NOT part of this
repository — including but not limited to nginx, PostgreSQL, Keycloak, the .NET
runtime, Node.js packages, and container base images — each under its own license,
some of which carry their own NOTICE files that must be propagated.

Those obligations attach to the distributed artifact, not to this source repository,
and are therefore not enumerated here. A bill of materials and a complete
attributions bundle are generated as part of the appliance build.

The compliance-runner build context (runners/compliance-runner/) additionally
installs, at build time from their own public sources: PowerCLI and
VMware.vSphere.SsoAdmin (PowerShell Gallery), cinc-auditor, the MITRE SAF CLI
(@mitre/saf), and the train-vmware InSpec transport plugin (VMware, Apache-2.0,
rubygems.org) -- none of these are vendored into this repository; the Dockerfile
fetches them at image-build time.
